      "heading": "The Albion story",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Albion appointed the former Liverpool assistant on 8 June 2012. His first season ended in eighth place with 49 Premier League points; the final match was the extraordinary 5–5 draw with Manchester United."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sources": [
